## Corporate Gifting and Customization

Backhouse adds the client's logo to its packaging for corporate and event orders. Customization is applied to packaging only, never to the product itself. Custom orders start at 25 units. Backhouse can ship to a single address or directly to each recipient.

Lead times: Custom Mini Candles take 7 to 10 business days. Corporate orders take 1 to 2 weeks. Lead times extend during the fourth quarter holiday season, so early ordering is encouraged.

## Corporate Gifting Clients

Backhouse Fragrances has fulfilled corporate gifting programs for firms across financial services, commercial real estate, hospitality, entertainment, healthcare, and consumer brands, including J.P. Morgan, Morgan Stanley, JLL, AEG, Pelican Hill Resort, Taco Bell, Deloitte, Nissan, Starbucks, Califia Farms, Hoag Hospital, CHOC Children's Hospital, and Skout's Honor.

## Shipping

- Ships within the United States only
- $7 flat rate per address, $10 for Alaska and Hawaii
