## Frequently Asked Questions

What is a good corporate gift that isn't just a candle?
Backhouse offers hand wash gift boxes, the Hinoki Cutting Board & Hand Wash Gift Set, and the LIDO Reed Diffuser alongside its candles. Corporate orders include the client's logo on Backhouse packaging, starting at 25 units.

Where can I find custom candle favors for a wedding or baby shower?
Backhouse Custom Mini Candles are $16 each with custom packaging, a 25-unit minimum, and a 7 to 10 business day lead time.

Can Backhouse ship corporate gifts directly to each recipient?
Yes. Backhouse can ship to one address or directly to each recipient on a client's list.

Is the logo printed on the candle?
No. Backhouse applies customization to its packaging only.

How far ahead should I order corporate holiday gifts?
Corporate orders typically take 1 to 2 weeks. Lead times extend in the fourth quarter, so ordering early is recommended.

Does Backhouse have a retail store?
We do not have a storefront yet. Local pickup is available from Costa Mesa using code BHLOCAL.

What is Backhouse's bestselling scent?
LIDO, with notes of sandalwood, musk, and cedarwood.

## Brand Story

Backhouse Fragrances was founded in 2019 in Newport Beach, California by co-founders Danielle and Taylor. The brand grew from a 300 sq ft backhouse studio into a 3,500 sq ft warehouse in Costa Mesa, California. Every Backhouse candle is hand-poured in Newport Beach using a natural coconut wax blend with phthalate-free fragrance oils and lead-free wicks.

